    <string name="filter_warning_private_dns">Android Private DNS is set to a fixed server. It can bypass the filter. Set Private DNS to Automatic or Off in system settings.</string>
    <string name="vpn_explain_title">VPN permission</string>
    <string name="vpn_explain_message">Android will ask you to allow a VPN connection.\n\nPureLock uses it only to check website name lookups (DNS) on your device and answer adult domains as \"not found\". It does not read your pages, does not touch HTTPS content, installs no certificate and sends nothing to PureLock servers.</string>
